  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bilateral development cooperation within the field of peace and security</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bilateralt utvecklingssamarbete inom fred och s&#xE4;kerhet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Folke Bernadotteakademin (FBA) ansvarar tillsammans med Sida f&#xF6;r genomf&#xF6;randet av Sveriges strategi f&#xF6;r utvecklingssamarbete med Colombia 2017-2021. FBA:s arbete ska bidra till st&#xE4;rkt kapacitet att arbeta med konfliktf&#xF6;rebyggande, fredsbyggande och j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Together with Sida, the Folke Bernadotte Academy (FBA) is responsible for the implementation of Sweden&apos;s development cooperation strategy with Colombia 2017-2021. FBA&apos;s work shall contribute to improved capacity in conflict prevention, peacebuilding and gender equality within the Security Sector.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I relation till fredsprocessen i Colombia bedriver FBA sedan 2013 utbildningsinsatser, erfarenhetsutbyte och teknisk r&#xE5;dgivning avseende eldupph&#xF6;r samt avv&#xE4;pning, demobilisering och &#xE5;teranpassning av f&#xF6;re detta kombattanter (DDR). FBA bedriver &#xE4;ven verksa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In relation to the peace process in Colombia, since 2013, FBA has conducted educational efforts, exchanged experiences, and provided technical advice regarding the ceasefire and disarmament, demobilization and reintegration of former combatants (DDR). FBA</narrative>
  </description>
